rchived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2024-10-18T23:05:51Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T20:53:02Z","closed_at":"2024-10-19T05:39:41Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\r\n\r\n- Reproducible in 3.6.stable\r\n- Not reproducible in: 3.5.3.stable\r\n\r\n### System information\r\n\r\nWindows 10, Godot 3.6\r\n\r\n### Issue description\r\n\r\nIn the Project Settings of the Godot Editor starting from 3.6, the Audio category now shows up as collapsible, with a \"General\" tab underneath it containing the backported audio settings from 4.x. \r\nIn 3.5.x, the Audio category was a standalone entry.\r\n\r\nThis led me to think the audio settings in Godot 3.6 were straight up removed, because I'd click the General button expecting the audio settings to be there instead.\r\n\r\nYou have to click the name of the collapsible category to access the Audio settings now. No other category in the Project Settings behaves like this.\r\n\r\nAudio category in Godot 3.5:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/472a9fa7-6ef1-4fd6-bf84-5f065d5a78d5)\r\n\r\nAudio category in Godot 3.6:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fe35d650-b542-4c0b-a93b-f0c79ee11e4a)\r\nNote that the header does not completely light up when selected, and you can click the general tab thinking you've opened the actual audio settings. The general tab contains TTS and iOS related settings.\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ff47c35e-4401-4717-80ac-b9ff14329168)\r\n\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nOpen the Project Settings in Godot 3.6 after loading any project (even a blank one) and look for the Audio category.\r\n\r\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\r\n\r\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98326/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98326/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}